WEBVTT

00:05:59.563 --> 00:06:00.606
“I see you.”

00:06:01.023 --> 00:06:02.066
“We see you.”

00:06:02.983 --> 00:06:06.195
Why does connecting to deep time
matter to us all?

00:06:06.987 --> 00:06:11.200
Shortsightedness may be the greatest
threat to humanity.

00:06:11.659 --> 00:06:15.496
To be human is to understand
that we’re part of a long continuum.

00:06:16.122 --> 00:06:18.582
Let’s embrace our cosmic context,

00:06:18.582 --> 00:06:20.668
respect our origins

00:06:20.668 --> 00:06:22.878
and hold our future close.

00:06:23.754 --> 00:06:24.755
Thank you.